{
  "title": "Dua al-Hujjah اِلٰهِيْ بِحَقِّ مَنْ نَاجَاكَ",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "According to (the book of) Muhajj al-Da’waat, this is the supplicatory prayer of the Proof of Allah (i.e. Imam al-Mahdi al-Hujjah):\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْم\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاِلٰهِيْ بِحَقِّ مَنْ نَاجَاكَ\nELAAHI BEHAQQE MAN NAAAJAAKA \nO my Allah, in the name of all those who have besought you \nوَ بِحَقِّ مَنْ دَعَاكَ\nWA BEHAQQE MAN DA-A’AKA \nand in the name of all those who have prayed to you \nفِي الْبَرِّ وَ الْبَحْرِ\nFILBARRE WAL BAHRE \nin lands and seas,\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nbless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَ تَفَضَّلْ عَلٰى فُقَرَاۤءِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA TAFAZZAL A’LAA FOQARAAIL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nbestow upon the poor among the believing men and women \nبِالْغَنَاۤءِ وَ الثَّرْوَةِ\nBILGHANAAE WAS SARWATE\nwith wealth and fortune,\nوَ عَلٰى مَرْضَى الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA A’LAA MARZAL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nupon the ailed believing men and women \nبِالشِّفَاۤءِ وَ الصِّحَّةِ\nBISH SHEFAAE WAS SEHHATE\nwith healing and health, \nوَ عَلٰۤى اَحْيَاۤءِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA A’LAA AHYAAIL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nupon the living believing men and women \nبِاللُّطْفِ وَ الْكَرَمِ\nBILLUTFE WAL KARAME\nwith kindness and generosity, \nوَ عَلٰۤى اَمْوَاتِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA A’LAA AMWAATIL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nupon the dead believing men and women \nبِالْمَغْفِرَةِ وَ الرَّحْمَةِ\nBILMAGHFERATE WAR RAHMATE\nwith forgiveness and mercy, \nوَ عَلٰى غُرَبَاۤءِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA A’LAA GHORABAAIL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nand upon the emigrant believing men and women \nبِالرَّدِّ اِلٰۤى اَوْطَانِهِمْ\nBIRRADDE ELAA AWTAANEHIM\nwith returning them home \nسَالِمِيْنَ غَانِمِيْنَ\nSAALEMEENA GHAANEMEENA\npeacefully and successfully, \nبِمُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِهِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ.\nBE-MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI AJMAE’ENA.\nin the name of Muhammad and the members of his Household."
}
